  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASSOCIATION IMPACT SENEGAL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SENETCH programme in Senegal, implemented by Association Impact Senegal aims to contribute to train 32 young semi-professional (16 men - 16 women) in light technology and sound engineering for better professional integration in the cultural and creative industries sector. The main activities of the programme are outlined in the Curriculum for both the Light and Sound training certifications. Both courses are divided into two sections, comprised of vocational and educational compentencies which must be completed. This includes 5 vocational compentencies, and 7 educational competencies for light training, and 4 vocational competencies and 9 educational competencies in sound.</narrative>
  </description>
